OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FCloudy with outbreaks of
OL,6,Flocally heavy rain in the early
OL,7,Fmorning. This will soon turn showery
OL,8,Fbefore becoming dry by midday and then
OL,9,Fbrighter from the late afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FThe evening will be mostly
OL,12,Fdry with only a chance of an odd
OL,13,Fshower. The night will then stay dry
OL,14,Fwith clear periods.
OL,15,
OL,16,CSunday:FDry with bright or sunny
OL,17,Fspells in the morning. The afternoon
OL,18,Fwill stay dry as cloud spreads east.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
