OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:
OL,6,FOutbreaks of locally heavy rain spread
OL,7,Feast Monday afternoon. Scattered
OL,8,Fshowers become isolated Tuesday
OL,9,Fevening. Showery rain, some heavy or
OL,10,Fthundery, will spread east Wednesday
OL,11,Fafternoon.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
